WEBVTT

00:00:05.750 --> 00:00:09.110
Sora... Take care of Yuzu.

00:00:10.470 --> 00:00:13.800
Yuzu... Stay safe.

00:00:14.320 --> 00:00:17.730
We're going to go back, with everyone.

00:00:19.520 --> 00:00:20.490
With everyone.

00:00:25.600 --> 00:00:29.040
Now, for the final battle of the second round!

00:00:29.040 --> 00:00:34.550
The last pair, trying for the final 
four, is Hugo and Serena!

00:00:34.550 --> 00:00:38.250
Serena! Serena! Serena!

00:00:38.540 --> 00:00:41.040
It isn't only Sergey and Yuya.

00:00:41.040 --> 00:00:43.500
Serena has an important role to play, too.

00:00:44.570 --> 00:00:47.520
To be loved by both Tops and Commons.

00:00:47.520 --> 00:00:51.480
And to become the star of 
hope for everyone in City.

00:00:54.020 --> 00:00:55.580
D-Wheels.

00:00:56.200 --> 00:00:59.790
Riding duels are fought while 
racing on these machines,

00:00:59.790 --> 00:01:01.480
which are an evolution of the duel disks.

00:01:01.480 --> 00:01:04.920
They combine speed and thrills for the ultimate show,

00:01:04.920 --> 00:01:07.080
a symbol of freedom to all.

00:02:41.040 --> 00:02:46.010
The Dice Roll of Fate

00:02:46.010 --> 00:02:49.710
Hugo! Hugo! Hugo! Hugo!

00:02:55.240 --> 00:02:58.620
My heart's on fire right now.

00:02:59.410 --> 00:03:01.610
Just like the sun, burning red.

00:03:02.420 --> 00:03:07.330
That's right. With this burning heart, 
I swear upon that sun.

00:03:08.520 --> 00:03:11.570
Rin... And Yuzu, in heaven...

00:03:12.120 --> 00:03:15.620
For your sakes, I will win this duel.

00:03:16.120 --> 00:03:17.540
Watch me.

00:03:19.560 --> 00:03:21.080
Wonder if I've got a cold...

00:03:22.320 --> 00:03:24.980
Serena just arrived on the course!

00:03:24.980 --> 00:03:28.240
Serena! Serena! Serena!

00:03:30.610 --> 00:03:32.230
What are you staring at?

00:03:34.240 --> 00:03:36.350
Your opponent is right here!

00:03:36.350 --> 00:03:38.890
To ignore your opponent...

00:03:38.890 --> 00:03:42.150
Don't you know basic etiquette for duelists?!

00:03:44.660 --> 00:03:45.870
Rin...

00:03:47.070 --> 00:03:48.270
Rin!

00:03:49.080 --> 00:03:51.040
Stay away!

00:03:55.110 --> 00:03:55.780
Rin?

00:03:56.680 --> 00:04:00.660
Does he mean another girl with the 
same face as Yuzu's and mine?

00:04:01.580 --> 00:04:03.800
Hugo! What're you doing?

00:04:03.800 --> 00:04:06.090
Keep your hands off my Serena!

00:04:06.490 --> 00:04:07.450
Rin...

00:04:07.450 --> 00:04:08.790
I'm not Rin.

00:04:09.230 --> 00:04:11.060
I'm Serena!

00:04:17.380 --> 00:04:18.440
I see.

00:04:22.100 --> 00:04:23.910
Let me ask, just to be sure...

00:04:24.680 --> 00:04:26.380
You really aren't Rin?

00:04:26.950 --> 00:04:28.910
Keep your face away from me!

00:04:32.130 --> 00:04:32.880
Rin!

00:04:34.470 --> 00:04:35.340
Rin!

00:04:35.340 --> 00:04:36.470
Shut up!

00:04:37.100 --> 00:04:38.200
Rin!

00:04:38.800 --> 00:04:42.480
Hey, Hugo... How long are you 
going to keep this up?

00:04:42.480 --> 00:04:43.860
We can't start like this.

00:04:44.400 --> 00:04:48.260
And, Serena, you can settle 
any scores with the duel.

00:04:49.350 --> 00:04:50.490
It's time?

00:04:51.000 --> 00:04:53.340
Um, anyway...

00:04:53.720 --> 00:04:57.340
Sorry for the wait. Time for the 
second round's final duel.

00:04:57.340 --> 00:04:59.080
Action Field, on!

00:04:59.080 --> 00:05:01.810
Field Spell Crossover Acceleration!

00:05:03.950 --> 00:05:05.680
Duel Mode, on.

00:05:05.680 --> 00:05:08.150
Autopilot, stand by.

00:05:08.530 --> 00:05:10.600
Hey, wait a minute!

00:05:12.870 --> 00:05:14.830
Riding duel...

00:05:16.030 --> 00:05:17.400
Acceleration!

00:05:17.400 --> 00:05:18.490
Duel!

00:05:19.030 --> 00:05:22.410
Wow! Hugo's late out of the gate!

00:05:22.410 --> 00:05:26.470
Will Serena be first out of the Duel 
Palace, and take the first turn?!

00:05:27.510 --> 00:05:31.200
Serena, you must win.

00:05:31.200 --> 00:05:33.830
No matter what it takes.

00:05:35.480 --> 00:05:39.550
All staff, pay close attention to the 
movements of Serena's D-Wheel.

00:05:39.550 --> 00:05:40.580
Yes, sir.

00:05:48.320 --> 00:05:49.790
Yuzu did, as well...

00:05:50.310 --> 00:05:52.260
But she really is identical to Rin.

00:05:53.490 --> 00:05:57.590
At this rate, it'll be just like I'm 
fighting a riding duel with Rin.

00:06:01.410 --> 00:06:03.940
Rin, this was our dream, huh?

00:06:04.580 --> 00:06:08.400
To someday duel together 
in front of a large crowd.

00:06:08.400 --> 00:06:09.960
Hey, hey, hey!

00:06:11.100 --> 00:06:13.440
Quit grinning at me like that.

00:06:13.440 --> 00:06:15.020
It's creeping me out.

00:06:15.830 --> 00:06:20.230
But the duel you fought against 
Sawatari was quite spectacular.

00:06:21.490 --> 00:06:22.830
I've got high hopes.

00:06:25.200 --> 00:06:27.270
I've got high hopes for you, Hugo.

00:06:27.270 --> 00:06:29.000
Yahoo!

00:06:29.630 --> 00:06:31.740
Hugo races forward!

00:06:34.210 --> 00:06:36.170
Serena's out of the gate, too!

00:06:36.170 --> 00:06:38.140
Hugo takes the first turn!

00:06:38.140 --> 00:06:41.560
Let's go... My turn!

00:06:41.560 --> 00:06:44.420
I summon Speedroid Den-Den Daiko Duke.

00:06:52.400 --> 00:06:54.520
And I end my turn.

00:06:55.640 --> 00:06:56.490
Hey.

00:06:58.360 --> 00:07:03.000
You summon a monster with 1200 attack points, 
in attack position, and you're done?

00:07:03.920 --> 00:07:05.800
What about your set cards?

00:07:05.800 --> 00:07:08.140
Are you mocking me?!

00:07:09.910 --> 00:07:12.680
I guess I got my hopes up for nothing.

00:07:13.100 --> 00:07:14.310
I'm disappointed.

00:07:16.590 --> 00:07:18.480
My turn!

00:07:18.790 --> 00:07:22.450
I summon Lunalight Purple Butterfly!

00:07:28.660 --> 00:07:32.960
And I activate my fusion spell card 
Polymerization from my hand!

00:07:32.960 --> 00:07:35.170
Not "Fusion"! It's "Hugo"!

00:07:35.170 --> 00:07:38.140
Shut up! I don't understand 
anything out of your mouth!

00:07:38.140 --> 00:07:40.000
Shut up, and listen to me take my turn!

00:07:40.580 --> 00:07:44.750
Its effect lets me fuse Lunalight Blue Cat

00:07:44.750 --> 00:07:47.220
and Lunalight White Rabbit in my hand!

00:07:47.890 --> 00:07:50.360
The cat loitering in the blue darkness.

00:07:50.360 --> 00:07:53.320
The rabbit that flashes in the moonlight.

00:07:53.320 --> 00:07:57.640
Swirl in the moon's gravity and 
be reborn with new power!

00:08:00.130 --> 00:08:01.590
Fusion Summon!

00:08:02.130 --> 00:08:05.740
Appear, Lunalight Cat Dancer!

00:08:08.930 --> 00:08:12.900
Serena completes a Fusion Summon, 
right off the bat!

00:08:13.300 --> 00:08:16.020
Lunalight Cat Dancer's effect activates!

00:08:16.020 --> 00:08:21.610
By tributing one Lunalight monster, I can 
attack all your monsters twice.

00:08:21.610 --> 00:08:23.820
Huh? What's that?

00:08:23.820 --> 00:08:27.190
I tribute Lunalight Purple Butterfly.

00:08:31.520 --> 00:08:32.460
Battle!

00:08:33.870 --> 00:08:34.990
Battle!

00:08:35.590 --> 00:08:36.380
Rin...

00:08:36.960 --> 00:08:40.930
I attack Den-Den Daiko Duke 
with Lunalight Cat Dancer!

00:08:47.100 --> 00:08:52.710
Lunalight Cat Dancer's effect means your 
monster isn't destroyed on the first attack.

00:08:54.480 --> 00:08:58.630
In exchange for not destroying 
the monster the first time,

00:08:58.630 --> 00:09:00.920
it can do extra damage on the second?

00:09:01.320 --> 00:09:05.390
Lunalight Cat Dancer attacks Den-Den 
Daiko Duke one more time!

00:09:05.920 --> 00:09:08.180
Full Moon Crester!

00:09:19.300 --> 00:09:22.270
In one attack, Hugo takes 2400 damage!

00:09:22.630 --> 00:09:26.480
Serena's dazzling first attack 
has Hugo on the ropes.

00:09:26.900 --> 00:09:31.500
That duelist, Serena, doesn't miss a trick.

00:09:31.500 --> 00:09:36.690
She's like an elegant diamond in the rough.

00:09:38.660 --> 00:09:41.740
Serena, you're great! You give me the shivers!

00:09:41.740 --> 00:09:44.630
What's wrong, Hugo? Get a grip!

00:09:44.950 --> 00:09:46.670
She's really good...

00:09:46.670 --> 00:09:49.100
Get it together, Hugo!

00:09:50.470 --> 00:09:55.810
Jeez, you always get carried away 
and end up dragging me down.

00:09:55.810 --> 00:10:03.820
Participation Prize

00:09:56.230 --> 00:09:57.760
It's a bad habit.

00:09:57.760 --> 00:10:01.680
Stop getting distracted, and focus on winning!

00:10:01.680 --> 00:10:03.820
I know! Shut up!

00:10:04.680 --> 00:10:07.990
I know. Shut up.

00:10:08.840 --> 00:10:10.900
You've woken me up now.

00:10:18.070 --> 00:10:22.600
I've always known what to do, haven't I?

00:10:23.080 --> 00:10:24.330
Trust...

00:10:25.320 --> 00:10:26.960
I end my turn.

00:10:26.960 --> 00:10:28.270
I swore...

00:10:29.560 --> 00:10:32.140
That I would win the Friendship Cup.

00:10:32.890 --> 00:10:38.480
If Rin saw me acting so pathetically, 
she'd yell at me.

00:10:39.490 --> 00:10:40.760
I see.

00:10:40.760 --> 00:10:44.100
But this will end on my next turn.

00:10:44.100 --> 00:10:45.720
You're pretty confident.

00:10:47.840 --> 00:10:50.120
The match isn't over yet.

00:10:50.120 --> 00:10:52.560
Which means there's still a path to victory.

00:10:52.560 --> 00:10:54.140
I'll show you

00:10:54.140 --> 00:10:58.670
I'm really strong, now that I'm awake!

00:10:58.670 --> 00:11:00.390
My turn!

00:11:02.180 --> 00:11:04.430
When there are no monsters 
on my side of the field,

00:11:04.430 --> 00:11:08.220
I can Special Summon Speedroid 
Terrortop from my hand.

00:11:14.890 --> 00:11:19.520
And I Normal Summon Speedroid Red-Eyed Dice!

00:11:24.330 --> 00:11:28.870
Level 1 Red-Eyed Dice tunes Level 3 Terrortop!

00:11:29.830 --> 00:11:32.570
Shadow of the maze with a thousand faces,

00:11:32.570 --> 00:11:35.990
tear through the darkness of confusion 
with your honed blade.

00:11:36.800 --> 00:11:37.940
Synchro Summon!

00:11:38.660 --> 00:11:43.080
Hi-Speedroid Puzzle!

00:11:45.150 --> 00:11:49.100
Hugo completes a dazzling Synchro Summon!

00:11:50.820 --> 00:11:53.630
If you'd managed a Synchro Summon 
like that at the start,

00:11:53.630 --> 00:11:56.620
you might have offered me 
a more substantial duel.

00:11:57.560 --> 00:11:59.850
But your dueling is full of sloppy mistakes.

00:12:00.680 --> 00:12:03.950
Duels don't have to be so precise...

00:12:03.950 --> 00:12:05.140
What did you say?

00:12:05.900 --> 00:12:07.800
It's true that you're strong.

00:12:08.200 --> 00:12:12.110
But your duels are too well-mannered.

00:12:13.280 --> 00:12:16.850
Judging by how things have gone, 
you'd be expected to win.

00:12:17.300 --> 00:12:20.850
But the nature of duels is they 
don't always follow theory.

00:12:20.850 --> 00:12:24.360
There's no path to victory without logic!

00:12:24.360 --> 00:12:25.910
Are you sure about that?

00:12:27.040 --> 00:12:28.060
Battle!

00:12:28.360 --> 00:12:32.250
I attack Lunalight Cat Dancer with Puzzle.

00:12:33.530 --> 00:12:35.270
I activate Puzzle's effect!

00:12:35.270 --> 00:12:39.580
Once per turn, when this card battles 
a Special Summoned monster,

00:12:39.580 --> 00:12:42.620
it can double its attack points, for one battle!

00:12:42.620 --> 00:12:43.510
Go!

00:12:43.510 --> 00:12:45.420
Hugo attacks!

00:12:45.420 --> 00:12:48.480
Will Serena's ace monster be destroyed?

00:12:49.090 --> 00:12:52.250
Move course point DD05 to G10.

00:12:52.250 --> 00:12:55.690
Then send Serena's D-Wheel down that route.

00:12:55.970 --> 00:12:58.860
Course point DD05 to G10.

00:13:01.980 --> 00:13:02.860
What?

00:13:03.200 --> 00:13:06.330
The course is changing. The course is changing.

00:13:16.550 --> 00:13:18.440
The course changed?

00:13:22.700 --> 00:13:24.850
I can't slow down in time!

00:13:31.520 --> 00:13:34.230
What? A sudden course change?

00:13:34.230 --> 00:13:37.610
What's going on here? No one notified me!

00:13:38.080 --> 00:13:40.820
All things bend to those with power...

00:13:41.240 --> 00:13:43.400
That is the rule of this world.

00:13:47.470 --> 00:13:49.810
I activate my Action Spell Big Escape!

00:13:49.810 --> 00:13:51.820
I end the Battle Phase.

00:13:53.670 --> 00:13:56.890
Ending the Battle Phase also 
ends Puzzle's effect.

00:13:56.890 --> 00:13:58.620
Its attack points return to normal.

00:13:58.910 --> 00:14:03.320
Serena uses the course change to 
get an Action Card in front of her.

00:14:03.320 --> 00:14:05.320
She avoided big damage!

00:14:06.400 --> 00:14:08.700
Hey! Didn't I tell you?

00:14:10.150 --> 00:14:13.580
The road ahead can change 
in all kinds of ways!

00:14:15.000 --> 00:14:18.520
Although that one was a real close shave.

00:14:20.780 --> 00:14:23.820
I set two cards and end my turn.

00:14:25.570 --> 00:14:27.680
Was that your doing, Roget?

00:14:30.320 --> 00:14:31.620
This duel...

00:14:31.900 --> 00:14:34.660
It is entirely within my control.

00:14:45.650 --> 00:14:50.030
Just as I thought, it seems like 
we'll finish this next turn, right?

00:14:50.030 --> 00:14:51.840
You're still saying that?

00:14:52.750 --> 00:14:57.310
You don't just resemble her... 
You're as stubborn as she is.

00:14:57.310 --> 00:14:58.740
My turn!

00:14:59.130 --> 00:15:02.120
I summon Lunalight Black Sheep!

00:15:05.190 --> 00:15:08.550
And I activate my spell card 
Polymerization from my hand.

00:15:09.400 --> 00:15:13.940
I fuse Lunalight Black Sheep 
and Lunalight Cat Dancer!

00:15:14.440 --> 00:15:16.880
The beast that hides in the ebony black.

00:15:16.880 --> 00:15:20.180
The beautiful beast that dances in moonlight.

00:15:20.180 --> 00:15:24.490
Swirl in the moon's gravity and 
be reborn with new power!

00:15:25.220 --> 00:15:26.640
Fusion Summon!

00:15:26.970 --> 00:15:31.540
Appear, graceful beast who 
dances in moonlit fields!

00:15:32.760 --> 00:15:35.500
Lunalight Panther Dancer!

00:15:40.150 --> 00:15:42.920
The effect of Lunalight Black Sheep 
in my graveyard activates!

00:15:43.440 --> 00:15:47.390
When this card is sent to the graveyard 
as a fusion component,

00:15:47.390 --> 00:15:48.860
I return it to my hand.

00:15:49.590 --> 00:15:51.650
I'll end it this turn.

00:15:51.650 --> 00:15:52.800
Battle!

00:15:52.800 --> 00:15:57.270
I attack Puzzle with Lunalight Panther Dancer!

00:15:57.270 --> 00:16:01.240
Hugo is in trouble again from 
this new monster!

00:16:02.450 --> 00:16:03.940
I activate Puzzle's effect.

00:16:04.310 --> 00:16:06.990
When it does battle with a 
Special Summoned monster,

00:16:06.990 --> 00:16:09.960
I can double its attack points, for one battle.

00:16:10.920 --> 00:16:14.890
Hugo doubled his monster's attack 
points to reduce the damage!

00:16:15.630 --> 00:16:17.720
I knew that was coming, of course.

00:16:18.040 --> 00:16:19.620
Panther Dancer's effect activates.

00:16:20.200 --> 00:16:24.860
This card lets me attack every monster 
on your side of the field twice.

00:16:25.810 --> 00:16:28.640
It has the same effect as Cat Dancer?

00:16:28.640 --> 00:16:34.610
When I use this effect, the monster isn't 
destroyed on the first attack, either...

00:16:40.160 --> 00:16:42.580
Hugo's life is down to 1400!

00:16:45.780 --> 00:16:49.660
Puzzle's effect ends, and its attack 
points return to normal.

00:16:51.570 --> 00:16:53.020
This might be trouble.

00:16:53.020 --> 00:16:56.640
Panther Dancer has 2800 attack points.

00:16:56.640 --> 00:16:58.000
It's over.

00:16:58.540 --> 00:16:59.830
Ready?

00:16:59.830 --> 00:17:01.820
No, wait a minute...

00:17:03.120 --> 00:17:05.970
Is there nothing that Hugo can do?

00:17:06.710 --> 00:17:09.960
Oh, no... At this rate, I really will lose.

00:17:10.500 --> 00:17:11.620
What do I do?

00:17:15.180 --> 00:17:16.340
There!

00:17:19.400 --> 00:17:20.380
No!

00:17:20.380 --> 00:17:21.870
An Action Card?

00:17:23.270 --> 00:17:27.320
Move course point ZL02 to DM01.

00:17:29.040 --> 00:17:32.570
The course is changing. The course is changing.

00:17:36.100 --> 00:17:37.350
What?

00:17:37.740 --> 00:17:40.240
You're kidding me!

00:17:41.520 --> 00:17:45.180
Another course change? What's going on?

00:17:45.180 --> 00:17:49.150
The course changed, and Hugo 
misses the Action Card!

00:17:50.520 --> 00:17:56.060
Roget seems to have full control over this duel.

00:17:57.960 --> 00:18:01.660
These course changes... Were they planned?

00:18:02.100 --> 00:18:03.060
No.

00:18:03.340 --> 00:18:07.220
This time, I feel like the goddess 
of luck has abandoned me.

00:18:08.290 --> 00:18:12.540
I can't get Action Cards. My life is down to 1400.

00:18:13.160 --> 00:18:16.010
Looks like I'm finished...

00:18:17.380 --> 00:18:19.510
Sorry, Rin.

00:18:20.420 --> 00:18:22.280
How long will you torture yourself?

00:18:23.540 --> 00:18:28.690
Really, Hugo, you give up so easily!

00:18:28.690 --> 00:18:30.720
It doesn't matter how many hours you think.

00:18:31.330 --> 00:18:33.680
Whatever you do, I still win.

00:18:33.680 --> 00:18:35.730
Just give up already.

00:18:35.730 --> 00:18:39.130
Shut up! The duel isn't over yet!

00:18:39.830 --> 00:18:41.700
I guess not, but...

00:18:42.720 --> 00:18:47.300
Your refusal to give up might 
also be your greatest strength.

00:18:47.960 --> 00:18:50.140
That's right. My strength is...

00:18:50.880 --> 00:18:53.990
I waited. Are you ready now?

00:18:53.990 --> 00:18:57.960
Go! Panther Dancer attacks Puzzle!

00:18:59.590 --> 00:19:00.820
Die!

00:19:01.720 --> 00:19:04.320
I have no choice. I activate my trap!

00:19:05.140 --> 00:19:06.140
Re-dyce-cle!

00:19:07.480 --> 00:19:11.760
I activate this card, targeting one Synchro 
Monster in my Extra Deck.

00:19:11.760 --> 00:19:14.970
I choose Clear Wing Synchro Dragon!

00:19:24.240 --> 00:19:25.810
Odd-Eyes?

00:19:25.810 --> 00:19:30.580
And I negate the effect of one Dice monster 
in my graveyard, Red-Eyed Dice,

00:19:30.580 --> 00:19:31.520
to Special Summon it!

00:19:36.680 --> 00:19:41.250
Red-Eyed Dice's level equals the number 
that comes up in a roll of a die

00:19:41.250 --> 00:19:45.960
And Red-Eyed Dice is used as a component 
to Synchro Summon the selected monster!

00:19:46.520 --> 00:19:48.760
Puzzle, on the field, is Level 4.

00:19:48.760 --> 00:19:53.560
In order to bring out Level 7 
Clear Wing, I need to roll a 3.

00:19:54.640 --> 00:19:57.320
But if it's any other number,

00:19:57.320 --> 00:20:00.780
all monsters on my side of 
the field are destroyed!

00:20:01.400 --> 00:20:03.110
All destroyed?

00:20:03.680 --> 00:20:06.580
A true all-or-nothing battle.

00:20:07.170 --> 00:20:10.460
I wanted to use an Action Card to avoid this,

00:20:10.460 --> 00:20:12.560
but I'll just have to gamble it all!

00:20:12.940 --> 00:20:16.190
Duels that rely on luck are 
nothing but games.

00:20:16.190 --> 00:20:20.300
That's what makes them fun... 
That's why duels are worthwhile!

00:20:20.850 --> 00:20:23.900
Please, my dice roll of fate.

00:20:24.300 --> 00:20:25.270
Go!

00:20:35.430 --> 00:20:36.380
What?

00:20:36.380 --> 00:20:40.660
Yes! Red-Eyed Dice becomes Level 3!

00:20:41.110 --> 00:20:42.390
Let's go!

00:20:44.520 --> 00:20:49.260
Level 3 Red-Eyed Dice tunes Level 4 Puzzle!

00:20:53.490 --> 00:20:58.440
Flap your beautiful and heroic wings, to strike 
the enemy at the speed of light.

00:21:01.520 --> 00:21:03.010
Synchro Summon!

00:21:03.510 --> 00:21:08.150
Appear, Level 7 Clear Wing Synchro Dragon!

00:21:10.770 --> 00:21:14.450
The 2500-attack-point Clear 
Wing Synchro Dragon

00:21:14.450 --> 00:21:19.160
is on Hugo's field, in place of 
the 1300-attack-point Puzzle!

00:21:20.590 --> 00:21:24.490
But Panther Dancer still has more attack points.

00:21:24.490 --> 00:21:26.400
You're still at a disadvantage.

00:21:26.400 --> 00:21:30.630
Am I? I really don't like to give up.

00:21:48.710 --> 00:21:50.730
Clear Wing Synchro Dragon...

00:21:54.790 --> 00:21:55.780
Serena!

00:21:57.360 --> 00:21:58.820
Let's go!

00:22:05.250 --> 00:22:08.150
The fun is only getting started!

00:23:49.480 --> 00:23:53.100
I thought I told you... A duel that 
relies on luck is merely a game.

00:23:53.100 --> 00:23:55.050
I won't duel that way!

00:23:55.050 --> 00:23:56.380
Sounds great.

00:23:56.380 --> 00:24:01.660
Level 1 Red-Eyed Dice tunes 
Level 7 Clear Wing!

00:24:01.660 --> 00:24:06.320
Let the clear wings, infused with holy power, 
shine and strike at the enemy!

00:24:06.770 --> 00:24:07.860
Synchro Summon!

00:24:08.430 --> 00:24:12.000
Appear, Crystal Wing Synchro Dragon!

00:24:12.440 --> 00:24:15.900
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ARC-V: 
Wings of Crystal.

00:24:15.900 --> 00:24:17.770
The fun is only getting started!
